Error [jet.SocketModuleNotOnTarget]: `core.http.server` is not available for target `wasm32-unknown-unknown`.
  --> Tests/UI/wasip2_unsupported_surface_e3304.jet:2:18
    |
  2 | use http_server: core.http.server
    |                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `core.http.server` needs native sockets or WASI Preview 2 sockets, and this target provides neither runtime boundary. A `jet build` or `jet run` run reports this target-support diagnostic.
 Fix: Build for `wasm32-wasip2` or a supported native target, or remove the `core.http.server` import.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3304
